@1 = ~Truth be told, yes. My crops are being eaten by disgusting bugs the size of a boulder. They appeared quite recently and brought me a lot of headache. The village relies heavily on my plants and vegetables and I can't have these creatures keep feeding on it. They are burrowing underneath the field and... their movement aerates the soil and their nutrient-rich excrement acts as an excellent fertilizer but... they keep ruining my fields.~
@2 = ~We can take care of them for you if they come.~
@3 = ~Insects are not our problem. Deal with it.~
@4 = ~Right on time! Here they come!~
@5 = ~Thank you. This was an epic battle but we prevailed. I don't have much to give you but take this potion as a token of my gratitude.~
@6 = ~Is there anything else you may need help with?~
